      * Two printer files in one source (RV-62): one DDS member for each
     H
     FREPORT1 O         132             PRINTER
     FREPORT2 O          80             PRINTER
     C                     MOVE 'ACME'    NAME    10
     C                     EXCPT HEAD1
     C                     EXCPT HEAD2
     OREPORT1 E                HEAD1
     O                                   20 'Report one'
     O                         NAME      40
     OREPORT2 E                HEAD2
     O                                   20 'Report two'
     O                         NAME      40
